## Update

This is available in Streamlit 1.63+. You can rerun another fragment from a widget callback without rerunning the full app:

```python
@st.fragment(key="cv_preview")
def cv_preview():
    st.write(st.session_state.get("contact", ""))

@st.fragment
def contact_details():
    st.session_state.contact = st.text_input("Name")
    st.button("Submit", on_click=lambda: st.rerun("cv_preview"))

contact_details()
cv_preview()
```
